  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "FluxMedia 1.1.5: UI binding moved to PlayerBinding in the Avalonia package; Player exposes read-only actual values, async commands and triggering-thread events. Playback rates default to the configurable 0.1-10 range. Bounds are configured globally in FluxEngineOptions and validated by Start. Audio filter stage counts are derived automatically from both bounds; MaxAudioTempoStages is read-only. Start rejects ranges requiring more than 16 stages. Audio/video rate confirmation, seek interruption, recording finalization and resource cleanup fixes. FFmpeg.AutoGen 9.0.1.1; native libraries must match the selected binding ABI.",
